      "content": "SP 80 SE              WENDOVER          BOWOOD LANE                                         WENDOVER DEAN 13/217                                  Wendoverdean Farmhouse GV                                      II House. C18 red with some vitreous brick, old tiled roof with flanking chimneys. 2-storeys, 3-bay front of sash windows with segmental brick arches; central door. C19 rendered wing on RH and long 1-storey outbuilding on LH now a shop, neither of special interest. Listing NGR: SP8821304605"
